ss guitars, drums and one unmistakable voice.'}</p><a class="hero-cta" href="${h.heroCtaRoute||'#/albums'}">${h.heroCtaLabel||'Listen / Explore →'}</a></div></div></section><section class="home-after"><div class="wrap"><div class="home-intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">${h.introEyebrow||'The band'}</div><h2 class="home-section-title">${htmlLines(h.introTitle||'Two basses.\nDrums. Voice.')}</h2></div><div><p class="home-lede">${h.introText||"BEAST came out of Cape Town in 2012 with a deliberately unusual setup: two bass guitars, drums and Inge Beckmann's voice."}</p><a class="text-link" href="${h.introLinkRoute||'#/band'}">${h.introLinkLabel||'Read the band story'}</a></div></div><div class="lineup home-lineup"><div class="eyebrow">Line-up</div>${members.map((m,i)=>`<div class="lineup-row"><span>${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><strong>${m[0]}</strong><span class="meta">${m[1]} — ${m[2].replace('Also of ','ex ')}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="tiles home-tiles">${[['01','Albums','Smoke Swig Swear and Bardo.','albums'],['02','Timeline','From basement sessions to Bardo.','timeline'],['03','Shows','Launches, festivals and live history.','shows'],['04','News','Latest updates and press archive.','news'],['05','Gallery','The complete visual archive.','gallery']].map(t=>`<a class="tile" href="#/${t[3]}"><span class="n">${t[0]}</span><div><h3>${t[1]}</h3><p>${t[2]}</p></div></a>`).join('')}</div><section class="news-home"><div><div class="eyebrow">${h.latestEyebrow||'Latest update'}</div></div><div class="news-list">${news.slice(0,3).map(n=>`<article><div class="meta">${n[0]} — ${n[1]}</div><h3>${n[2]}</h3><p>${n[3]}</p></article>`).join('')}<div style="padding-top:17px"><a class="text-link" href="#/news">${h.latestLinkLabel||'All latest updates and press'}</a></div></div></section><section class="follow"><div><div class="eyebrow">${h.followEyebrow||'Follow us'}</div><h2 style="font-size:44px;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0">${h.followTitle||'Stay close'}</h2></div><div class="socials">${socials.map(s=>`<a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="${s[2]}"><span>${s[0]}</span><span>${s[1]}</span></a>`).join('')}</div></section></div></section></main>`}
function band(){const b=CMS.band||{},pm=b.pastMember||{};return shell(b.pageEyebrow||'Bios',b.pageTitle||'The Band',`<div class="section-grid">${members.map((m,i)=>`<article class="member"><span>${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><h2>${m[0]}</h2><div class="meta">${m[1]}</div><div class="meta" style="margin-top:7px">${m[2]}</div><p>${m[3]}</p></div></article>`).join('')}</div><div class="twocol"><div class="box"><div class="eyebrow">Past members</div><h2>${pm.name||'Sasha Righini'}</h2><div class="meta">${pm.role||'Drums · 2011–2013'}</div><p class="bodycopy">${pm.bio||''}</p></div><div class="box"><div class="eyebrow">Instrumentation</div><p class="bodycopy" style="font-size:20px">${b.instrumentation||''}</p></div></div>`)}
function timelinePage(){return shell('2011 — Present','Timeline',`<div class="timeline">${timeline.map((t,i)=>`<article class="timeline-row"><div class="year">${t[0]}</div><div><h2>${t[1]}</h2><p class="bodycopy">${t[2]}</p>${t[3]?`<a class="text-link archive-source" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="${t[3]}">Source ↗</a>`:''}</div><div class="meta">Step ${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')} / ${String(timeline.length).padStart(2,'0')}</div></article>`).join('')}</div><div style="padding-top:34px;font-size:28px;font-weight:700">Still loud. Still two basses.</div>`)}
function trackList(key){const a=albumsData[key];return `<div class="tracklist">${a.tracks.map((t,i)=>`<div class="trackline"><span>${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><strong>${t[0]}</strong><span class="meta">${t[1]}</span></div>`).join('')}<div class="track-summary meta">${a.tracks.length} songs · ${a.total}</div></div>`}
function albumLinks(a){const q=encodeURIComponent('BEAST Cape Town '+a.title);return `<div class="album-links"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="${a.spotify||'https://open.spotify.com'}">Spotify</a><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="${a.apple||('https://music.apple.com/us/search?term='+q)}">Apple Music</a><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="${a.youtube||('https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query='+q)}">YouTube</a></div>`}
function albums(){const aa=Array.isArray(CMS.albums)?CMS.albums:[];const fallback=[{key:'smoke',title:'Smoke Swig Swear',year:'2013',image:ASSETS.smoke,type:'Studio album',recorded:'Sound and Motion Studios, Cape Town — four days, September 2012',release:'1 January 2013 · Beast',description:"BEAST's debut album, recorded in Cape Town and officially launched at The Assembly on 23 February 2013."},{key:'bardo',title:'Bardo',year:'2015',image:ASSETS.bardo,type:'Studio album',recorded:'Heritage Sound, Cape Town — October 2014, produced by Brendyn Rossouw',release:'6 February 2015 · Beast',description:'The second BEAST album, themed around the state between life and death and launched at The Assembly in Cape Town on 27 February 2015.'}];const list=aa.length?aa:fallback;return shell('Discography','Albums',`${list.map(a=>`<article class="album"><div><img src="${a.image||ASSETS[a.key]||''}" alt="${a.title} album artwork"></div><div><div class="meta">${a.type||'Studio album'} · ${a.year||''}</div><h2>${a.title||''}</h2><div class="detail"><span class="meta">Recorded</span><span>${a.recorded||''}</span></div><div class="detail"><span class="meta">Release</span><span>${a.release||''}</span></div>${albumLinks(a)}${trackList(a.key)}<p class="bodycopy">${a.description||''}</p></div></article>`).join('')}<div class="eyebrow">Videography</div><div class="video-list">${videography.map(v=>`<a class="video-row" target="_blank" href="${v[3]}"><span>${v[0]}</span><span class="video-title"><strong>${v[1]}</strong><span class="meta">${v[2]}</span></span></a>`).join('')}</div>`)}
function lyricsPage(){return shell('Words, album by album','Lyrics',`<div class="tabs"><button class="pill active" data-album="smoke">